message: "If you cite this project (and thereby strengthen its standing as prior art), please use the metadata below."
type: software
title: "through-metal-link: open platform for ultrasonic power and data through solid metal walls"
authors:
  - family-names: Gerasimov
    given-names: Vitalii
repository-code: "https://github.com/zeloras/through-metal-link"
url: "https://github.com/zeloras/through-metal-link"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CERN-OHL-W-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - ultrasonic power transfer
  - through-metal communication
  - piezoelectric transducer
  - open hardware
abstract: >-
  Open-hardware platform delivering watts of power and kbit/s of data through
  blind 3-5 mm steel walls using piezoelectric transducer pairs, with no
  penetrations. Built exclusively on expired-patent prior art.
